{"title":"","link":"https://bradbarrish.com/2026/04/19/robert-angie-shayna-and-i.html","date":1776664943000,"content":"<p>Robert, Angie, Shayna and I hiked Bronson Canyon on Saturday. Too many people with speakers, but some great views of the city and the Hollywood sign. I took the first two photos and Shayna snapped the other one.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog/4832/2026/img-0337.jpg\" alt=\"Birds are flying in a clear blue sky.\" /><img src=\"https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog/4832/2026/img-0329.jpg\" alt=\"Auto-generated description: A scenic view showcases a sprawling city skyline in the distance, framed by rolling green hills under a clear blue sky.\" /><img src=\"https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog/4832/2026/img-7886.jpg\" alt=\"Auto-generated description: Two people and a dog stand on a scenic hilltop with a red bench, overlooking a distant cityscape.\" /></p>","author":"","siteTitle":"Brad Barrish","siteHash":"91e49f51884b2947fac16e947ba7e59fe5a24800befb4760d388da1b057f4f23","entryHash":"0b4e49dcd632630880afa0d8bfbef23e07482d6ef18e85bd69e536c586d77990","category":"Sites"}